// Upstream Lean 4 fixed-precision integer overflow (extdeps_external_authority_anchor, cited
// 2026-08-01): literals that overflow their type's precision are interpreted modulo the precision;
// signed types use twos-complement (lean-lang Fixed-Precision-Integers). Init.Data.UInt.Basic
// documents UInt8.add, UInt8.mul, UInt8.pow, and width conversions as wrapping around on overflow.
// Catalog fixed-width scalars ground on ReturnWrapping — not saturating, trap, or undefined.

data lean_upstream_fixed_width_overflow_returns_rule: OverflowReturnValueRule = ReturnWrapping
